WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:03.120
What if I told you&nbsp;

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:07.520
that time travel and teleportation…
don’t actually involve travel at all?

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.400
That you can do either—
in an instant.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.840
In this video, I’ll show you exactly how,
using a powerful exercise from The Architect&nbsp;

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.400
that changes everything.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.800
Time travel isn’t something
you build a machine for.&nbsp;

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:25.040
It doesn’t require a portal,
a wormhole, or even movement.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:29.680
Here’s the secret:
it’s already happening—constantly.&nbsp;

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:34.560
You just haven’t yet recognized
the mechanism or how to use it consciously.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.560
Let’s break the illusion.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:40.560
Everything is energy.
And everything—including you—&nbsp;

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:44.080
has a unique vibrational signature.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:48.000
Part of that signature
is what we call your locational variable.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.520
The place you are at,
right now in space-time&nbsp;

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:55.200
is an energetic coordinate
within your own field.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:00.320
Location is not something you go to.
It’s part of who you are.

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:02.880
If you isolate that locational variable,&nbsp;

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:06.800
for example, the locational variable
of where you are, at this moment,&nbsp;

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:11.920
and replace it with a locational variable
of another place, like your front door…

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:16.080
You wouldn’t move.
You would cease to exist here,&nbsp;

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:18.880
and instantly appear at your front door.

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:21.920
No motion.
The only thing that changed&nbsp;

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:26.960
is your locational variable,
which moved you from here – to there.

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:31.040
Another example:
When you move a pencil across a table,&nbsp;

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:34.640
you think it travels.
But really, what's happening&nbsp;

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:40.320
is the pencil stops existing at Point A...
and appears at Point B.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:44.000
You redefined its coordinates
with your intention.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.200
So then… why do we see
the progression of movement&nbsp;

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:51.600
instead of the pencil
simply disappearing and reappearing?

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:55.280
That’s called the Illusion of continuity.

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:58.880
In 3rd dimensional reality,
our consciousness agrees&nbsp;

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:01.760
to experience time as a progression.

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.320
In reality, the pencil goes through&nbsp;

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:08.320
billions of still frames
to get from Point A to Point B,&nbsp;

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:13.040
like frames in a movie
rapidly playing one after the other.

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:17.600
Without this illusion of flow,
life as we know it wouldn’t exist.

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:21.600
To experience motion,
we must experience time.

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:24.080
We wouldn’t able to see
the beauty of a sunset&nbsp;

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:28.000
as the sun slowly moves
towards the horizon.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.640
We couldn’t listen
to the progression of a song.

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:33.840
We couldn’t experience “change.”

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:38.320
But movement is really just
rapid location redefinition.&nbsp;

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:40.480
Frame by frame.

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:45.040
So.. what IS
the locational variable REALLY?

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:47.520
Geometrically, it’s a nested frequency&nbsp;

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:51.760
pattern inside you –
your position in space and time…&nbsp;

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:57.440
which is a set of vectors and ratios,
embedded within your own toroidal field.

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:01.280
Mathematically, it behaves
like a complex equation,&nbsp;

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:06.400
made of direction, density, time,
and state of consciousness.

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:11.440
Sort of like what a GPS coordinate
would look like as a harmonic.

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:18.400
Energetically, it is a standing wave—
your field is a resonance signature.

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:22.960
Location isn’t a place.
It’s a frequency you’re tuned to.

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:25.280
Now here’s where it gets deeper.

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:28.480
That locational variable
doesn’t just say where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:32.800
you are in space—
it says WHEN you are.

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:37.280
Teleportation is a shift
in spatial frequency. Space.

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:41.600
Time travel is a shift
in temporal frequency. Time.

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:43.840
They are two aspects
of the same mechanism.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:48.640
Teleportation is your field
reorienting its frequency pattern&nbsp;

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:53.200
to a new location,
and instant materialization follows.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:58.720
Time Travel is tuning in
to a different phase of the collective now.

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:01.920
Changing your locational variable
doesn’t mean “moving through”&nbsp;

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.600
time or space.

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:06.240
It means changing an energy signature&nbsp;

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:11.680
within your field’s position
on the nested helix of the universe.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:14.880
The Architect clarified
that the term “nested helix”&nbsp;

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:20.080
is how space-time is structured -
spiraling, layered geometry,&nbsp;

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:24.640
sort of like many interwoven spirals
inside of eachother.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:29.200
The locational variable
is how advanced civilizations navigate.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.960
When advanced crafts enter&nbsp;

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:35.840
our 3rd dimensional space time,
their entry is not through motion.

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:39.920
They phase in by redefining
their locational variable.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:43.520
The ship doesn’t move.
It disappears at their origin,&nbsp;

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:47.120
and instantly phases into our space-time.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:52.080
This is why many people have witnessed
sudden, silent, or directionless flight&nbsp;

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.240
of these advanced crafts.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:58.640
Multiple high ranking government officials
and pilots have witnessed this type&nbsp;

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:02.160
of activity on many occasions
and it’s been well-documented&nbsp;

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:06.480
in the recent congressional disclosure
on UAPs.

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:09.040
Once inside our space-time, however,&nbsp;

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:13.040
the motion of these crafts
is not as conventional as we think.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.680
They move along white energetic gridlines&nbsp;

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:20.640
of Earth’s planetary grid network –
a type of energetic scaffolding.

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:22.000
I go into this in more detail&nbsp;

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.880
in another video –
link is in the description.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:27.280
Back to teleportation and time travel,&nbsp;

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:32.160
and the Architect’s exercise
on how to do this yourself.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.200
Okay. The next part is the practice.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.920
Let’s do an exercise given by The Architect&nbsp;

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:42.240
to learn how to change
our own locational variable.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:44.880
Before you begin, the key is to recognize&nbsp;

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:48.640
that you are ALREADY
at your new desired location.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:52.560
You are not trying to get there.
You’re REDEFINING yourself.

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:59.440
And you MUST FULLY believe it.
All it takes is intention and belief.

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:03.920
The breath that we’re going to use
is The Helix Lock Breath,&nbsp;

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:09.520
and the pattern is (6–3–7–2)
(which I go into in much more detail&nbsp;

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:12.560
in another video – link in description).

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:19.600
This breath aligns your cranial
and sacral poles in a torsion spiral field,&nbsp;

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:25.360
ideal for anchoring your field
outside conventional directionality.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:31.040
Sit comfortably, spine upright.
Place one hand on your lower abdomen,&nbsp;

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:32.960
the other on your third eye.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:40.560
Inhale through the nose for 6 counts:
Visualize a golden double helix rising&nbsp;

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:44.640
from the base of your spine
to your pineal gland.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:48.560
Hold for 3:
Feel the spin lock in place,&nbsp;

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:55.760
as you become aware of a subtle
connecting current your root and crown.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.440
Exhale for 7:&nbsp;

00:06:57.440 --> 00:07:04.000
Let the helix radiate outwards
through your field like a pulse.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:11.680
Hold for 2:
In stillness, feel your field recalibrating.

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:16.400
Repeat for 3 more rounds before moving on.

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:19.040
And then, the redefinition technique:

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:24.720
First, create an isolation field.
In a calm, meditative state,&nbsp;

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:30.320
imagine a glowing, spherical boundary
around you, a gentle containment&nbsp;

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.560
of your own energy.

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:35.520
Then, enter the limbo state:&nbsp;

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:42.240
This is the state between all things—
it is both nothing and everything.

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:45.760
The eternal silence,
where you are no longer a person&nbsp;

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:50.560
with a name – release your identity,
you are no longer a body,&nbsp;

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:56.560
you no longer exist in a room –
you are pure consciousness.&nbsp;

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:58.640
Pure awareness.

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:03.760
Sit in the stillness… the silence…

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:09.600
Now… feel the new place:
Begin to tune your inner feeling&nbsp;

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:12.560
to the experience of your desired location.

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:15.680
Not the image of it,
but the knowing of it.&nbsp;

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:19.840
How it would feel
to already be there at that location.

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:22.560
Release all sense of directionality.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:30.000
Superimpose the vibration, the feeling,
of this new location over all other locations.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:35.280
You are not "going" to a new location—
you are becoming it.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:39.280
Let go of here.
Let go of trying to move.&nbsp;

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:44.720
Let go of imagining
left, right, forward, backward, up, down.

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:49.280
Instead, feel the new location
like a frequency inside your body,&nbsp;

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:51.840
and let it become your current one.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:56.800
You’re stepping into a new geometric
configuration of time and space.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:09:03.120
The current location dissolves…
You are becoming the new location.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:07.120
Reality will form around your new vibration.

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:14.320
You may feel lightness, disorientation,
a sense of distortion or float.

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:18.560
That is your field unlocking
from the old reference point.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:21.840
Release the idea
that you are locked in space and time.

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:25.120
You are not.
You are a holographic node –&nbsp;

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:30.480
a single point of awareness
that contains access to the whole.

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:32.080
When you change your frequency,&nbsp;

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:36.640
the entire reality around you
must shift to match.

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:40.800
Anything, everywhere, anywhen&nbsp;

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:44.640
all becomes accessible
when you realize this truth:

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:48.320
Your body doesn’t move
through time and space.

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:52.080
Your body is a projection
of your consciousness.

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:53.840
And that’s the secret.

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:58.000
Superhuman made simple –
with The Architect

